{"id": "64454", "title": "哥哥", "author": "女娲", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 28, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/64/64454.htm", "intro": "大宅院下有许多兄弟姐妹,在这权势的家中各据一方. \r\n\r\n最亲密的哥哥有两个,一个天使,一个是恶魔. \r\n\r\n哥哥们喜欢着自己的妹妹,血缘是他们名正言顺拥有她的证明. \r\n\r\n所以,妹妹就得服侍他们. \r\n\r\n不可以逃,她是他们的,世上最珍贵的宝贝. \r\n\r\n本文讲述的是一个懦弱的小白兔,如何在两个强大的哥哥面前逃脱,如何从懦弱变成女王.过程缓慢,循环无数次,最后达到成功.本文三P.", "base": "files/article/html/64/64454", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9609162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9609163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9609164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9609169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9609172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9609174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9609176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "9609179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "9609181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "9609183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "9609185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "9609191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "9609194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "9609197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "9609199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "9609202.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "9609204.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18", "file": "9609206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19", "file": "9609211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20", "file": "9609212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21", "file": "9609213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22", "file": "9609215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "9609217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24", "file": "9609220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25", "file": "9609222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26", "file": "9609224.ht